{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219810/extras/0184c5ce572679bbd04215daaf345b0d.avif?t=1749380937\" width=616 height=72 /></span>Akanemachi is a quiet, idyllic town where residents enjoy peaceful lives... That is, until an earthquake hits and eerie occurrences suddenly begin to plague the town. People start disappearing, crime increases dramatically, and all the townsfolk seem on edge. When her friend joins the list of missing persons, it's up to Aya, an ordinary resident of Akanemachi, to investigate the mysterious incidents, rid the town of a dangerous evil, and bring peace back to her town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219810/extras/aea6b43daf5e26481a2cf2ab6799948a.avif?t=1749380937\" width=616 height=72 /></span>Explore Akanemachi to gather information and key items that will help you with your investigation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By interacting with the townsfolk and roaming the town, you will gain new information and items that will allow you to unlock events and access new areas in the town, bringing you closer to unraveling the mysteries of Akanemachi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219810/extras/2a5a57a373c7f518641d25b1f7af24d5.avif?t=1749380937\" width=616 height=72 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219810/extras/2c7a682e38cb587f5ae1d58ea65599e9.avif?t=1749380937\" width=616 height=399 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219810/extras/6b6ea9ddd897244897779d8a216e6057.avif?t=1749380937\" width=616 height=72 /></span><strong>Charming Pixel Art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the look of a classic pixel game as you explore the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Puzzle Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the items and information you gather to devise plans to explore new areas and get yourself out of trouble.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2219810?t=1749380937","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749380937","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219810/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749380937","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219810/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749380937","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219810/extras/0184c5ce572679bbd04215daaf345b0d.avif?t=1749380937\" width=616 height=72 /></span>Akanemachi is a quiet, idyllic town where residents enjoy peaceful lives... That is, until an earthquake hits and eerie occurrences suddenly begin to plague the town. People start disappearing, crime increases dramatically, and all the townsfolk seem on edge. When her friend joins the list of missing persons, it's up to Aya, an ordinary resident of Akanemachi, to investigate the mysterious incidents, rid the town of a dangerous evil, and bring peace back to her town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219810/extras/aea6b43daf5e26481a2cf2ab6799948a.avif?t=1749380937\" width=616 height=72 /></span>Explore Akanemachi to gather information and key items that will help you with your investigation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By interacting with the townsfolk and roaming the town, you will gain new information and items that will allow you to unlock events and access new areas in the town, bringing you closer to unraveling the mysteries of Akanemachi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219810/extras/2a5a57a373c7f518641d25b1f7af24d5.avif?t=1749380937\" width=616 height=72 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219810/extras/2c7a682e38cb587f5ae1d58ea65599e9.avif?t=1749380937\" width=616 height=399 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219810/extras/6b6ea9ddd897244897779d8a216e6057.avif?t=1749380937\" width=616 height=72 /></span><strong>Charming Pixel Art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the look of a classic pixel game as you explore the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Puzzle Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the items and information you gather to devise plans to explore new areas and get yourself out of trouble.</p>","developers":["Sprite Hills"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2219810/header.jpg?t=1749380937","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Kagura G